  (text "LM61495RPHR / 400 kHz. Source is the protected pack, independent of charger SYS.\nScreen, USB hub and sensor-module output; USB/LTE startup pulses need measurement.\nThis rail switches off for charging sleep; branch fuse and connector ratings remain open."
